{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":51,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主對錫安的安慰"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「追求公義、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尋求耶和華的人啊，聽我說。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要追想那磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們是從那裡被鑿出來的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要追想那巖穴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們是從那裡被挖出來的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要追想你們的祖先亞伯拉罕和生你們的撒拉。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我呼召亞伯拉罕的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他孤身一人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我賜福給他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他人丁興旺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必安慰錫安和錫安所有的荒場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使曠野像伊甸園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使沙漠變成耶和華的園囿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"裡面有歡喜、快樂、感謝和歌頌的聲音。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"「我的子民啊，要留心聽我的話；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的國民啊，要側耳聽我說。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我必賜下訓誨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公正必成為萬民的光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公義臨近，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的拯救已經開始，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的臂膀要審判萬民。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾海島都在等候我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仰賴我的臂膀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們舉目仰望諸天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"俯首觀看大地吧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"諸天必像煙雲消散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地必像衣服一樣漸漸破舊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的居民必像蚊蠅一樣死亡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的救恩永遠長存，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公義永不廢除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"認識公義、銘記我訓誨的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聽我說。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不要害怕人的辱罵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要畏懼他們的譭謗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為蛀蟲必吃掉他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像吃衣服；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蟲子必蠶食他們，如食羊毛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的公義永遠長存，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的救恩延及萬代。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，伸出臂膀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"施展能力吧，施展能力吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像從前的日子、遠古的時代。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道不是你砍碎了拉哈伯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刺死了海怪嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道不是你使海洋和深淵乾涸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在深海中開出道路讓蒙救贖的人穿過的嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華救贖的子民必歸回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必歡唱著回到錫安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永遠的福樂必臨到他們頭上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必歡喜快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再沒有憂愁和歎息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「安慰你們的是我，是我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為什麼要害怕難逃一死、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"生命如草芥的世人呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你忘記了創造你、鋪展諸天、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"奠立大地根基的耶和華嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的欺壓者大發怒氣，決意毀壞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就整天驚恐不安嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的怒氣在哪裡呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被囚的人快得釋放了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不會死在牢中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不會缺乏食物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是你的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我翻動大海、捲起波濤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華是我的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我把我的話傳給你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用我的手庇護你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我鋪展諸天，奠立大地的根基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對錫安說，『你是我的子民。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["耶路撒冷啊，醒來，醒來，站起來吧！",{"text":"你從耶和華手中的杯裡喝了祂的憤怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝乾了那杯使人東倒西歪的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你生育的兒子沒有一個來引導你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你撫養成人的眾子沒有一個來攙扶你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這兩樣災禍臨到你身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰會為你哀哭呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒涼和毀滅、饑荒和戰禍臨到你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能安慰你呢","poem":1},{"noteId":22},{"text":"？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的孩子昏倒在街頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像羚羊掉進網羅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們飽嘗耶和華的烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"承受你上帝的責備。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這身受痛苦、並非因酒而醉的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聽好了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的主耶和華是為祂子民申辯的上帝，祂說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，我已從你手中拿走那使人東倒西歪的杯，就是盛滿我憤怒的碗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不再喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必把這杯給苦待你的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們對你說，『趴下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們好從你身上走過。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你把你的背當作地面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當作街道任人走過。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":22,"caller":"+","text":"「誰能安慰你呢」有古卷作「我該怎樣安慰你呢」。","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":19}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/51.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/52.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/50.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}